\ y(t)\\end{aligned}]=\\,\\,$</td>\n<td align=\"center\" height=\"40px\" width=\"5px\"></td>\n<td align=\"center\" width=\"80px\">{{field-1}}</td>\n<td align=\"center\" width=\"5px\"></td>\n</tr><tr>\n<td align=\"center\"></td>\n<td align=\"center\">$\\operatorname{sinh}⁡(7t)$</td>\n<td align=\"center\"></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>" :question/worked-solution "Writing our system in matrix form, we get\n\n$$\n{x}^{′}(t)=[\\begin{aligned}0 & 7 \\\\ 7 & 0\\end{aligned}]x(t)+g(t),\n$$\n\nwhere $x(t)=[\\begin{aligned}x(t) \\\\ y(t)\\end{aligned}]$ and $g(t)=[\\begin{aligned}0 \\\\ 7\\end{aligned}].$ So, the matrix of the system is $A=[\\begin{aligned}0 & 7 \\\\ 7 & 0\\end{aligned}].$\n\nGiven the system ${x}^{′}(t)=Ax(t)+g(t),$ where $A$ is a constant square matrix, the solution of the initial value problem can be written as the sum of the homogeneous part and a particular solution:\n\n$$\nx(t)={{{e}^{A(t-{t}_{0})}\\,x({t}_{0})}_{⏟}}_{\\text{homogeneous part}}+{{{\\int }_{{t}_{0}}^{t}{e}^{A(t-s)}g(s)\\,\\text{d}s}_{⏟}}_{\\text{particular solution}},\n$$\n\nwhere $x({t}_{0})$ is the initial condition vector. \n\nLet's evaluate each part separately:\n\n- First, we find the homogeneous part. We are given that \n\n$$\n{e}^{At}=[\\begin{aligned}\\operatorname{cosh}⁡(7t) & \\operatorname{sinh}⁡(7t) \\\\ \\operatorname{sinh}⁡(7t) & \\operatorname{cosh}⁡(7t)\\end{aligned}].\n$$\n\nSince the initial conditions are given at $t={t}_{0}=0,$ we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{e}^{A(t-{t}_{0})} & ={e}^{At}\\,x(0) \\\\  & =[\\begin{aligned}\\operatorname{cosh}⁡(7t) & \\operatorname{sinh}⁡(7t) \\\\ \\operatorname{sinh}⁡(7t) & \\operatorname{cosh}⁡(7t)\\end{aligned}][\\begin{aligned}0 \\\\ 0\\end{aligned}] \\\\  & =[\\begin{aligned}0 \\\\ 0\\end{aligned}].\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\n- Next, we find the particular solution. Notice that \n\n$$\n{e}^{A(t-s)}=[\\begin{aligned}\\operatorname{cosh}⁡(7(t-s)) & \\operatorname{sinh}⁡(7(t-s)) \\\\ \\operatorname{sinh}⁡(7(t-s)) & \\operatorname{cosh}⁡(7(t-s))\\end{aligned}].\n$$\n\nSo, we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{e}^{A(t-s)}g(s) & =[\\begin{aligned}\\operatorname{cosh}⁡(7(t-s)) & \\operatorname{sinh}⁡(7(t-s)) \\\\ \\operatorname{sinh}⁡(7(t-s)) & \\operatorname{cosh}⁡(7(t-s))\\end{aligned}][\\begin{aligned}0 \\\\ 7\\end{aligned}] \\\\  & =[\\begin{aligned}7\\operatorname{sinh}⁡(7(t-s)) \\\\ 7\\operatorname{cosh}⁡(7(t-s))\\end{aligned}].\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThus, we obtain\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\int }_{0}^{t}{e}^{A(t-s)}g(s)\\,\\text{d}s & ={\\int }_{0}^{t}[\\begin{aligned}7\\operatorname{sinh}⁡(7(t-s)) \\\\ 7\\operatorname{cosh}⁡(7(t-s))\\end{aligned}]\\text{d}s \\\\  & ={[\\begin{aligned}-\\operatorname{cosh}⁡(7(t-s)) \\\\ -\\operatorname{sinh}⁡(7(t-s))\\end{aligned}]}_{s=0}^{s=t} \\\\  & =[\\begin{aligned}\\operatorname{cosh}⁡(7t)-1 \\\\ \\operatorname{sinh}⁡(7t)\\end{aligned}].\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFinally, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}x(t) & =[\\begin{aligned}0 \\\\ 0\\end{aligned}]+[\\begin{aligned}\\operatorname{cosh}⁡(7t)-1 \\\\ \\operatorname{sinh}⁡(7t)\\end{aligned}] \\\\  & =[\\begin{aligned}\\operatorname{cosh}⁡(7t)-1 \\\\ \\operatorname{sinh}⁡(7t)\\end{aligned}].\\end{aligned}\n$$"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186396771 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186229133 :knowledge-point/id #uuid "4c4b78fa-76af-5261-87a0-d1960aa0fe04" :knowledge-point/title "Proving the Matrix Exponential Formula for IVP Solution of an Inhomogeneous System"}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "9530b4e7-da11-5019-bfe8-3c2149892dac" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "applying a change of variables" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186396773} {:answer/id #uuid "ab035245-455a-59ab-8725-7b2b3dc1b537" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "differentiating and using the product rule" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186396774} {:answer/id #uuid "8146923c-9627-55e5-9466-bdd3d14e27c8" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "evaluating at $t={t}_{0}$" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186396775} {:answer/id #uuid "fc90c463-3f03-5883-940f-f248e494a4a3" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "substituting ${x}^{′}(t)=Ax(t)+g(t)+{t}_{0}$" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186396776}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "ab035245-455a-59ab-8725-7b2b3dc1b537" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "differentiating and using the product rule" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186396774} :answer-field/id #uuid "21df18ce-22e3-5482-85f0-c55067bec64a" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045494 :db/ident :answer-field.type/select} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186396772} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "1c21b5ac-b71d-524b-81d0-0ef3b970b6ed" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "{e}^{A(t-{t}_{0})}y(t)=x(t)+{t}_{0}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186396778} {:answer/id #uuid "078d5599-c846-5039-bd9a-02645d761385" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "y({t}_{0})=x({t}_{0})" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186396779} {:answer/id #uuid "414722be-f5ce-5a13-b003-003856e09c08" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "y(t)={e}^{-A(t-{t}_{0})}x(t)" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186396780} {:answer/id #uuid "8f7dcfe0-2d58-5f8f-a1ec-6818a8f4d297" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "{x}^{′}(t)=Ax(t)+g(t)+{t}_{0}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186396781}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "078d5599-c846-5039-bd9a-02645d761385" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "y({t}_{0})=x({t}_{0})" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186396779} :answer-field/id #uuid "db0709dd-b7af-5eba-a79a-d6543cc0bc73" :answer-field/key "field-3" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045494 :db/ident :answer-field.type/select} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186396777} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "353cd3bb-d381-57af-8c36-f62844de59d4" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "differentiating and using the sum rule" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186396783} {:answer/id #uuid "321a4ddc-5528-5e6b-b7f9-7d47a93777cc" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "multiplying both sides by ${e}^{A(t+{t}_{0})}$" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186396784} {:answer/id #uuid "522ad4b4-3746-5cfb-9fb2-8aab4c9517cc" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "multiplying both sides by ${e}^{A(t-{t}_{0})}$" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186396785} {:answer/id #uuid "6363a9f5-c0ba-5662-baa1-b274c296d0e8" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "evaluating at $t={t}_{0}$" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186396786}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "522ad4b4-3746-5cfb-9fb2-8aab4c9517cc" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "multiplying both sides by ${e}^{A(t-{t}_{0})}$" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186396785} :answer-field/id #uuid "fd5e78af-494a-5d4c-bd14-0efe8866e777" :answer-field/key "field-4" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045494 :db/ident :answer-field.type/select} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186396782} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "449e233e-966c-5368-ab81-8afbf466bc71" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\text{L1}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186396788} {:answer/id #uuid "04fa3eb6-36f3-5879-83e8-a5950409c5d0" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\text{L4}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186396789} {:answer/id #uuid "4f6cdd58-17c9-5b97-9775-beddb57446ae" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\text{L3}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186396790} {:answer/id #uuid "4fb7fb5b-f4f6-55a9-8057-b2b401444da8" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\text{L5}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186396791}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "04fa3eb6-36f3-5879-83e8-a5950409c5d0" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\text{L4}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186396789} :answer-field/id #uuid "41a55de6-34d3-58e7-8fef-7488002a7430" :answer-field/key "field-2" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045494 :db/ident :answer-field.type/select} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186396787}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045487 :db/ident :question.difficulty/moderate} :question/id #uuid "d73d6273-7a31-5998-90dd-91a300f07c9c" :question/math-academy-id "q-335422" :question/problem "Consider the inhomogeneous system  ${x}^{′}(t)=Ax(t)+g(t),$ where $A$ is a constant square matrix. A derivation of the formula for the solution $x(t)$ passing through $x({t}_{0})$ is presented below.\n\n$\\text{L1}:\\,$ Let $y(t)={e}^{-A(t-{t}_{0})}x(t)$  \n\n$\\text{L2}:\\,$ ${y}^{′}(t)=-A{e}^{-A(t-{t}_{0})}x(t)+{e}^{-A(t-{t}_{0})}{x}^{′}(t)$  \n\n$\\text{L3}:\\,$ ${y}^{′}(t)={e}^{-A(t-{t}_{0})}g(t)$  \n\n$\\text{L4}:\\,$ $y(t)-y({t}_{0})={\\int }_{{t}_{0}}^{t}{e}^{-A(s-{t}_{0})}g(s)\\,\\text{d}s$\n\n$\\text{L5}:\\,$ $y({t}_{0})=x({t}_{0})$ \n\n$\\text{L6}:\\,$ $y(t)=x({t}_{0})+{\\int }_{{t}_{0}}^{t}{e}^{-A(s-{t}_{0})}g(s)\\,\\text{d}s$  \n\n$\\text{L7}:\\,$ ${e}^{A(t-{t}_{0})}y(t)={e}^{A(t-{t}_{0})}x({t}_{0})+{\\int }_{{t}_{0}}^{t}{e}^{A(t-s)}g(s)\\,\\text{d}s$\n\n$\\text{L8}:\\,$ ${e}^{A(t-{t}_{0})}y(t)=x(t)$\n\n$\\text{L9}:\\,$ $x(t)={e}^{A(t-{t}_{0})}x({t}_{0})+{\\int }_{{t}_{0}}^{t}{e}^{A(t-s)}g(s)\\,\\text{d}s$\n\nSelect the correct options to justify each step of the reasoning.\n\n$\\,$ Line $\\text{L2}$ follows from $\\text{L1}$ by  \n{{field-1}}.\n\n$\\,$ Line $\\text{L6}$ follows from line\n{{field-2}}\nby substituting \n{{field-3}}.\n\n$\\,$ Line $\\text{L7}$ follows from line $\\text{L6}$ by  \n{{field-4}}." :question/worked-solution "Let's justify each of the selected steps.\n\n- We first consider lines $\\text{L1}$ and $\\text{L2}.$ Differentiating $y(t)={e}^{-A(t-{t}_{0})}x(t)$ and applying the product rule gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{y}^{′}(t) & =({e}^{-A(t-{t}_{0})})^{′}x(t)+{e}^{-A(t-{t}_{0})}{x}^{′}(t) \\\\  & =(-A){e}^{-A(t-{t}_{0})}x(t)+{e}^{-A(t-{t}_{0})}{x}^{′}(t) \\\\  & =-A{e}^{-A(t-{t}_{0})}x(t)+{e}^{-A(t-{t}_{0})}{x}^{′}(t).\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThus, $\\text{L2}$ follows from $\\text{L1}$ by $\\text{differentiating and using the product rule}.$\n\n- Next, we consider lines $\\text{L4}$, $\\text{L5}$, and $\\text{L6}.$ From $\\text{L4}$ we have\n\n$$\ny(t)-y({t}_{0})={\\int }_{{t}_{0}}^{t}{e}^{-A(s-{t}_{0})}g(s)\\,\\text{d}s.\n$$\n\nUsing $y({t}_{0})=x({t}_{0})$ from $\\text{L5}$, this becomes\n\n$$\ny(t)-x({t}_{0})={\\int }_{{t}_{0}}^{t}{e}^{-A(s-{t}_{0})}g(s)\\,\\text{d}s,\n$$\n\nso\n\n$$\ny(t)=x({t}_{0})+{\\int }_{{t}_{0}}^{t}{e}^{-A(s-{t}_{0})}g(s)\\,\\text{d}s.\n$$\n\nThus, $\\text{L6}$ follows from $\\text{L4}$ by substituting $y({t}_{0})=x({t}_{0}).$\n\n- Finally, we consider lines $\\text{L6}$ and $\\text{L7}.$ Multiplying both sides of\n\n$$\ny(t)=x({t}_{0})+{\\int }_{{t}_{0}}^{t}{e}^{-A(s-{t}_{0})}g(s)\\,ds\n$$\n\nfrom $\\text{L6}$ by ${e}^{A(t-{t}_{0})}$ gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{e}^{A(t-{t}_{0})}y(t) & ={e}^{A(t-{t}_{0})}x({t}_{0})+{e}^{A(t-{t}_{0})}{\\int }_{{t}_{0}}^{t}{e}^{-A(s-{t}_{0})}g(s)\\,\\text{d}s \\\\  & ={e}^{A(t-{t}_{0})}x({t}_{0})+{\\int }_{{t}_{0}}^{t}{e}^{A(t-s)}g(s)\\,\\text{d}s.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, $\\text{L7}$ follows from $\\text{L6}$ by $\\text{multiplying both sides by }{e}^{A(t-{t}_{0})}.$"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186311588 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186229133 :knowledge-point/id #uuid "4c4b78fa-76af-5261-87a0-d1960aa0fe04" :knowledge-point/title "Proving the Matrix Exponential Formula for IVP Solution of an Inhomogeneous System"}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "4869cc7c-37fe-52e5-9b43-ff957a5b547c" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "multiplying both sides by ${e}^{A(t-{t}_{0})}$" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186309299} {:answer/id #uuid "5832b58c-6d32-548b-9a50-7c21ea4c8621" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "multiplying both sides by ${e}^{A(t+{t}_{0})}$" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186309415} {:answer/id #uuid "880672a8-f0d6-578d-a2c8-ef18ae3dc7be" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "evaluating at $t={t}_{0}$" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186309816} {:answer/id #uuid "b46874ea-e741-55aa-878e-2673f5f766b2" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "differentiating and using the sum rule" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186310208}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "4869cc7c-37fe-52e5-9b43-ff957a5b547c" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "multiplying both sides by ${e}^{A(t-{t}_{0})}$" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186309299} :answer-field/id #uuid "34225276-7653-5b0f-a5ca-7302f56c1c43" :answer-field/key "field-3" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045494 :db/ident :answer-field.type/select} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186310930} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "1e7df846-5a0f-5c0e-a5af-2d5fd6577b33" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "multiplying both sides by ${e}^{A(t-{t}_{0})}$" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186308979} {:answer/id #uuid "8f23a9f5-6197-5ec0-b0b1-e772fb8433f9" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "evaluating at $t={t}_{0}$" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186309891} {:answer/id #uuid "9ca8cda8-2262-5144-865a-7bf2793c44c8" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045